    <section class="section"><div class="page-shell legal-layout"><article class="article-body"><p><strong>Last updated: 21 September 2026</strong></p><h2>Information we collect</h2><p>We may collect your name, email address, phone or WhatsApp number, nationality or customer type, travel dates, group size, accommodation preferences, and the details included in an enquiry or booking request. We also record newsletter consent and basic website analytics when enabled.</p><h2>How we use information</h2><p>We use your information to answer enquiries, coordinate requested travel services, send booking updates, improve the website, prevent misuse, and send offers or island news when you have chosen to join the newsletter.</p><h2>Who receives booking details</h2><p>Where necessary, we may share relevant request details with the guesthouse, transfer provider, excursion operator, fishing operator, or fulfilment partner handling your enquiry. We share only what is reasonably needed to respond or provide the requested service.</p><h2>Newsletter choices</h2><p>We send promotional email only after consent. You may unsubscribe or ask us to remove your address at any time. We do not sell newsletter addresses.</p><h2>Cookies and analytics</h2><p>The website may use essential cookies for security and forms. If analytics or advertising services are enabled, their providers may process device and usage information under their own privacy terms.</p><h2>Storage and security</h2><p>We use reasonable technical and organisational measures to protect stored information. No internet transmission or storage system can be guaranteed completely secure, and information is retained only as long as reasonably required for its purpose, records, security, or legal obligations.</p><h2>Your choices</h2><p>You may ask what personal information we hold about you or request a correction or deletion, subject to records we are required to retain. Contact us using the details below.</p><h2>External links</h2><p>This website may link to maps, social networks, booking channels, and other third-party services. Their privacy practices are governed by their own policies.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For privacy questions or requests, call <a href="tel:+9607779493">+960 7779493</a> or email <a href="mailto:hello@himmafushi.travel">hello@himmafushi.travel</a>.</p></article></div></section>
